sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller as ChatBotController<br/>(API)
    participant Mediator as Mediator<br/>(generated)
    participant Handler as WriteConversationContext<br/>CommandHandler<br/>(Application)
    participant Store as CosmosDataStore<br/>(Infrastructure)
    participant Cosmos as Azure Cosmos DB

    Client->>Controller: POST /chatbot/ask
    Controller->>Mediator: Send(WriteConversationContextCommand)
    Note over Mediator,Handler: RequestLoggingBehavior<br/>wraps the handler call
    Mediator->>Handler: Handle(command, cancellationToken)
    Handler->>Handler: Validate (FluentValidation)
    Handler->>Store: WriteConversationContextAsync(fullResponse)
    Store->>Store: ToDocument(context) via Mapperly
    Store->>Cosmos: CreateItemAsync(document, partitionKey)
    Cosmos-->>Store: 201 Created
    Store-->>Handler: completes
    Handler-->>Mediator: Result.Ok()
    Mediator-->>Controller: Result
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK
